;; expect: main.derive refused derive_shape
;; types that name each other are types of the logic, and no derivation reads their block:
;; a size among them is refused as the other capabilities are (derive_size: a type nested
;; through `List` alone has one)
(use Init.List cons nil)
(type T (TLeaf Int) (TNode (List A)))
(type A (MkA Int T))
(derive T size)
